  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "CubemapTexture manages the lifecycle of a WebGL cubemap, abstracting the loading of six individual face images into a single GPU texture. It inherits from Texture and handles asynchronous loading via promises, supporting both external URI loading and immediate generation of a white fallback cubemap. The class integrates serialization methods to persist its state, including URIs and the white cubemap flag, making it a specialized resource manager for rendering pipelines."
  },
